{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0000920","isObsolete":false,"name":"septum digestion after cytokinesis","definition":{"text":"The process of physically separating the septal cell wall material by enzymatic digestion, that occurs after daughter cells are separated by cytokinesis."},"comment":"This term should not be used to describe the last step of cytokinesis in organisms without a cell wall, ie, the cell resealing of the plasma membrane via abscission. Consider annotating to 'GO:0061952 midbody abscission' to capture this process.","synonyms":[{"name":"cell separation after cytokinesis","type":"related"},{"name":"cell separation following cytokinesis","type":"exact"},{"name":"cytokinetic cell separation","type":"related"},{"name":"daughter cell separation","type":"related"},{"name":"mitotic cytokinetic cell separation","type":"broad"}],"children":[{"id":"GO:0010590","relation":"regulates"},{"id":"GO:2001043","relation":"positively_regulates"},{"id":"GO:1905391","relation":"part_of"},{"id":"GO:2001042","relation":"negatively_regulates"},{"id":"GO:0030994","relation":"part_of"},{"id":"GO:0030995","relation":"part_of"}],"secondaryIds":["GO:1902409","GO:2000695"],"history":[{"timestamp":"2018-08-23","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"daughter cell separation"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"cell separation after cytokinesis"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Deleted","category":"SYNONYM","text":"mitotic cytokinetic cell separation"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Deleted","category":"SYNONYM","text":"rotokinesis"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"mitotic cytokinetic cell separation"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Updated","category":"TERM","text":"septum digestion after cytokinesis"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID